# TIN TROOP 4-B, the Jack of the Chest, with plain button presses (recorded
# once from a route plan). Each soldier marches out of the door, climbs to
# the ledge, and as the Jack springs out with his mouth open, jumps and
# lances straight down his throat. Three lances finish him.
game tintroop
wait 5
cheat unlock
press A
wait 5
press A
wait 30
press A
wait 5
wait 24
hold RIGHT 24
hold RIGHT+A 16
wait 5
hold RIGHT+A 16
wait 6
hold RIGHT 37
wait 45
hold A 5
hold A+B 2
wait 99
hold RIGHT 24
hold RIGHT+A 16
wait 5
hold RIGHT+A 16
wait 6
hold RIGHT 37
wait 90
hold A 5
hold A+B 2
wait 99
hold RIGHT 24
hold RIGHT+A 16
wait 5
hold RIGHT+A 16
wait 6
hold RIGHT 37
wait 90
hold A 5
hold A+B 2
wait 1
wait 200
expect boss_dead == 1
expect state == 4
expect goals & 2
